[{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-1109","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-1109.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-2215","title":"Google Android 内核 Binder 驱动释放后使用权限提升漏洞","description":"Android 内核 binder 驱动中存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞，当 binder 线程退出时，binder_proc 结构体未能正确同步引用计数，导致已释放的内存可被攻击者操控。本地攻击者可通过安装恶意应用或结合远程网络漏洞触发该漏洞，实现从应用层到 Linux 内核的权限提升，获取系统最高控制权。该漏洞影响 Android 多个版本，已有公开的 Metasploit 利用模块和独立 EXP 代码，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。Google 已在 2019 年 10 月安全公告中发布补丁修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-2215"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-10-11T19:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:33:27Z","remediation":"立即安装 Android 2019 年 11 月安全公告中的内核补丁，对应 Linux 内核主线 commit 7bada55ab50797b1f5f6c9d2c69a2e3fe0d4b2a9。对于 Android 10 及以下版本，升级至包含此补丁的 2019-11-05 或更新安全补丁级别（SPL）。若无法立即更新系统，可卸载不可信应用并限制 adb 调试权限作为临时缓解，但该漏洞可通过本地恶意应用无用户交互触发，建议优先完成内核升级。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/154911/Android-Binder-Use-After-Free.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/155212/Slackware-Security-Advisory-Slackware-14.2-kernel-Updates.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/156495/Android-Binder-Use-After-Free.html","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2019/Oct/38","http://www.huawei.com/en/psirt/security-advisories/huawei-sa-20191030-01-binder-en","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2020/01/msg00013.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2020/03/msg00001.html","https://seclists.org/bugtraq/2019/Nov/11","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20191031-0005/","https://source.android.com/security/bulletin/2019-10-01","https://usn.ubuntu.com/4186-1/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-2215","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/48129","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-2215.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/986b45a0ac2dd215b3a5515fba0cebac769043dd/2019/CVE-2019-2215.md","https://github.com/gmh5225/awesome-game-security/blob/db4bd55e9bfb7e33bd70735359b158d00ed6ab63/archive/jsirichai/CVE-2019-2215.txt","https://github.com/googleprojectzero/0days-in-the-wild/blob/de543c9d14d06a99861d9c1266293db8b018ab19/0day-RCAs/2019/CVE-2019-2215.md","https://github.com/gmh5225/awesome-game-security/blob/db4bd55e9bfb7e33bd70735359b158d00ed6ab63/description/jsirichai/CVE-2019-2215/description_en.txt","https://github.com/mthcht/awesome-lists/blob/c2dacc75a08e0bdd402794c815646af00e12d2cc/Lists/Others/Defender_yara_rules/AndroidOS/Exploit/CVE-2019-2215.yara","https://github.com/jiayy/android_vuln_poc-exp/blob/99d398a381cdbe12c0019075b8fa47b200e8a49f/android/EXP-CVE-2019-2215/cve-2019-2215.c","https://github.com/Al1ex/LinuxEelvation/blob/69cee23442f742c50809f75803b4ebca959f9927/CVE-2019-2215/cve-2019-2215.c","https://github.com/jiayy/android_vuln_poc-exp/blob/99d398a381cdbe12c0019075b8fa47b200e8a49f/android/EXP-CVE-2019-2215/README.md","https://github.com/CrackerCat/simpread/blob/1ec36a5827997f39a7a815e20121b12f8d781497/md/[原创]CVE-2019-2215 复现及分析.md","https://github.com/kangtastic/cve-2019-2215","https://github.com/timwr/CVE-2019-2215","https://github.com/sharif-dev/AndroidKernelVulnerability","https://github.com/0xbinder/android-kernel-exploitation-lab","https://github.com/DimitriFourny/cve-2019-2215"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-1109.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0124","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0124.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-17503","title":"Kirona DRS 未授权访问信息泄露漏洞","description":"Kirona Dynamic Resource Scheduling（DRS）5.5.3.5 版本存在未授权信息泄露漏洞。由于 `/osm/REGISTER.cmd`（即 `/osm_tiles/REGISTER.cmd`）接口缺少身份认证与访问控制，未经身份验证的远程攻击者可以直接访问该批处理文件，文件内包含的 SQL 查询语句会暴露数据库版本、表名、列名等敏感数据库结构信息。该漏洞影响 Kirona DRS 5.5.3.5 版本，攻击者无需任何凭据即可通过构造 HTTP 请求获取数据库元数据，为后续针对性的 SQL 注入或数据库渗透攻击提供重要依据。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2019-17503"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-10-11T17:15:09Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:24:01Z","remediation":"建议将 /osm/REGISTER.cmd 和 /osm_tiles/REGISTER.cmd 文件从 Web 可访问目录中移除或重命名，并在 Apache 配置中添加拒绝规则禁止直接访问 .cmd 文件：在 httpd.conf 或站点配置中加入 <FilesMatch \"\\.cmd$\"> Require all denied </FilesMatch>；同时删除已暴露的文件副本，检查 Web 服务器日志确认是否存在未授权访问记录，并通过 WAF 规则拦截对该路径的请求。如厂商已发布后续版本，建议联系 Kirona 技术支持获取补丁并升级至修复版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/154838/Kirona-DRS-5.5.3.5-Information-Disclosure.html","https://github.com/Ramikan/Vulnerabilities/blob/master/Kirona-DRS%205.5.3.5%20Multiple%20Vulnerabilities","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/47498","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-17503.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-17503.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/726e4f078d9c802d5468914ce95f8f208f8ae45a/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-17503.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2019-17503.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-17503-3985.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-17503-3986.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-17503-3987.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Kirona/CVE-2019-17503.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/74dc69e33a88e8337ec5752efbf3c7f9ff972c4b/cves/2019/17xxx/CVE-2019-17503.json","https://github.com/veo/vscan/blob/1beb10c08e377e15b7dd417be1843bb75aa8c4f0/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/cves/2019/CVE-2019-17503.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-17503.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-0124.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0124.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0500","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0500.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-1322","title":"Microsoft Windows 特权提升漏洞","description":"Windows 在处理身份验证请求时存在权限提升漏洞。由于 Windows 未正确验证身份验证请求的输入，本地攻击者可通过登录目标系统并运行特制的应用程序来触发该漏洞，成功利用后可获取 SYSTEM 权限，从而完全控制受影响系统。该漏洞影响所有受支持的 Windows 版本，攻击者需具备有效凭据和本地访问权限，攻击复杂度较低。Microsoft 已在 2019 年 10 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-1322"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-10-10T14:15:16Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:28:22Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2019 年 10 月安全更新：Windows 8.1/Server 2012 R2 用户安装 KB4520005（月度汇总）或 KB4519990（仅安全更新）；Windows 10 用户安装 KB4517389；Windows Server 2019 用户安装 KB4519338。可通过 Windows Update 自动获取更新，或从 Microsoft Update Catalog 手动下载安装。该漏洞需本地用户登录后利用，无法立即打补丁时，应限制非管理用户的本地登录权限并启用 Windows Defender 应用程序控制以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/155723/Microsoft-UPnP-Local-Privilege-Elevation.html","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2019-1322","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-1322","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-1322.md","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/TestFailure/CVE-2019-1322/README.md","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/TestFailure/CVE-2019-1322/README_EN.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-1320.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-1322.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-1340.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-1322.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-13229.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-13227.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-13228.md","https://github.com/apt69/COMahawk"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0500.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0017","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0017.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-1315","title":"Microsoft Windows 错误报告管理器权限提升漏洞","description":"Windows 错误报告管理器（Windows Error Reporting, WER）在处理硬链接时存在权限提升漏洞。本地低权限攻击者可通过创建恶意硬链接，利用 WER 组件以 SYSTEM 权限执行任意文件操作，从而将权限提升至 SYSTEM 级别。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需用户交互，影响 Windows 7/8/10 及 Windows Server 2008/2012/2016/2019 等多个版本。Microsoft 已在 2019 年 10 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-1315"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-10-10T14:15:15Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:28:21Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2019 年 10 月安全更新：Windows 10 1903 版安装 KB4517389，1809 版安装 KB4519338，1709 版安装 KB4520004，Windows Server 2019 安装 KB4519338。如无法立即打补丁，可限制低权限用户对 C:\\ProgramData\\Microsoft\\Windows\\WER 目录的写入权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2019-1315","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-1315","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-1315.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/57432302d64f9bc08597d61c88fc5f900569476d/2019/CVE-2019-1315.json","https://github.com/BC-SECURITY/Moriarty/blob/7ad4aa414021cc1be0d1a781cf1b727e3d5d3c34/Moriarty/Msrc/CVE-2019-1315.cs","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2019/1xxx/CVE-2019-1315.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-1315.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-1315.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-1339.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-1342.md","https://github.com/ryanmrestivo/red-team/blob/1e53b7aa77717a22c9bd54facc64155a9a4c49fc/Information-Gathering/_on-host/Watson/Watson/Msrc/CVE-2019-1315.cs","https://github.com/ryanmrestivo/blue-team/blob/34d08be7cb013de6a4d416a5476dd9e0c5810430/_OS_Analysis/Watson/Watson/Msrc/CVE-2019-1315.cs","https://github.com/Mayter/CVE-2019-1315"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0017.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0122","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0122.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-17418","title":"MetInfo CMS SQL注入漏洞","description":"MetInfo 7.0 后台语言管理模块中存在 SQL 注入漏洞。攻击者以管理员身份登录后台后，通过 `admin/?n=language&c=language_general&a=doSearchParameter` 接口的 `appno` 参数构造恶意 SQL 语句，可未经授权读取、篡改或删除数据库中的敏感信息。该漏洞与 CVE-2019-16997 为不同漏洞，需要具备高权限账户（PR:H）才能触发利用，影响 MetInfo 7.0 及更早版本，CVSS 评分为 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2019-17418"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-10-10T01:06:09Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:23:55Z","remediation":"立即将 MetInfo 升级到最新稳定版本（当前最新为 V8.1），或至少升级至 V7.1.0 及以上版本。该漏洞源于后台语言参数搜索功能（admin/?n=language&c=language_general&a=doSearchParameter）对 appno 参数未做输入过滤，导致高权限管理员可执行 SQL 注入。升级完成后，进入后台\"语言管理-语言列表\"确认语言参数搜索功能正常工作，并删除后台缓存（可视化界面-清空缓存）。如暂无法升级，临时措施为：在网站根目录 .htaccess 或 Nginx 配置中，对后台语言搜索接口增加 WAF 规则拦截包含单引号、UNION、SELECT 等 SQL 关键字特征的请求，限制只有本地 IP 可访问后台管理入口。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/evi1code/Just-for-fun/issues/2","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-17418.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-17418.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/1beabb4b11662cd835a2974a73ab3608623a1bdc/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-17418.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2019-17418.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-17418-3980.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-17418-3981.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-17418-3982.yaml","https://github.com/shadow1ng/fscan/blob/bf036fd9b272a56d493796badcf0a269f0a83ec0/webscan/pocs/metinfo-cve-2019-17418-sqli.yml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/MetInfo CMS/CVE-2019-17418.yaml","https://github.com/zan8in/afrog/blob/3ea4d34414bcc09b9e25a3f338294eca87e178ce/pocs/afrog-pocs/CVE/2019/CVE-2019-17418.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9180d6f38159151a7725b3a82799fa2950c45f22/cves/2019/17xxx/CVE-2019-17418.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-0122.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0122.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0095","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0095.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-15859","title":"Socomec DIRIS A-40 密码泄露漏洞","description":"socomec DIRIS A-40 设备 Web 管理界面存在敏感信息泄露漏洞（CWE-200），固件版本 48250501 之前受影响。攻击者可通过向目标设备发送 HTTP GET 请求访问 `/password.jsn` 路径，无需身份认证即可获取管理员明文密码，进而完全控制设备。该漏洞影响所有暴露了 Web 管理界面的 DIRIS A-40 设备，攻击条件简单，仅需网络可达即可利用。CVSS v3.1 评分为 9.8（严重），攻击复杂度低，无需交互，成功利用后可完全破坏设备机密性、完整性与可用性。厂商已发布固件更新修复此问题。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-15859"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-10-09T16:15:14Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:21:13Z","remediation":"立即将 Socomec DIRIS A-40 设备固件升级至 48250501 或更高版本，该补丁已修复 /password.jsn 端点明文泄露管理员凭据的漏洞。升级后重新配置设备凭据并启用强密码策略。若无法立即升级，应在网络边界对设备管理 Web 界面的访问 IP 实施严格 ACL 限制，仅允许受信任的管理网段访问，降低被远程利用的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/154764/Socomec-DIRIS-A-40-Password-Disclosure.html","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2019/Oct/10","https://www.socomec.com/single-circuit-multifunction-meters_en.html","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-15859.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-15859.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-15859.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2019-15859.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2019-15859-3896.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2019-15859-3899.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2019-15859-3895.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2019-15859-3900.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2019-15859-3898.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2019-15859_重复副本.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2019-15859.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-0095.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0095.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0121","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0121.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-17382","title":"Zabbix 仪表盘未授权访问漏洞","description":"Zabbix 监控系统在 zabbix.php?action=dashboard.view&dashboardid=1 处存在认证绕过漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可直接绕过登录页面访问仪表盘页面，并以匿名方式创建 Dashboard、Report、Screen 或 Map 等可视化元素。这些创建的内容可被平台其他用户及管理员访问，可能导致敏感监控数据泄露或恶意配置被持久化。该漏洞影响 Zabbix 4.4 及以下版本，攻击者无需凭据即可在 Web 界面完成利用，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.1,"aliases":["CVE-2019-17382"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-10-09T14:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:23:51Z","remediation":"立即将 Zabbix 升级至 4.0.15 或更高版本（4.4.2/5.0.0 亦可），新版本默认禁用 Guest 账号，可彻底消除未授权访问风险。如暂时无法升级，请登录 Zabbix 网页管理界面，进入 Administration → Users，将 Guest 用户的状态设置为 Disabled，或删除 Guest 用户并确认前端配置文件中未启用 guest 登录选项，同时在防火墙层面限制 zabbix.php 的对外访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2023/08/msg00027.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/47467","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-17382.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-17382.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/2204bbca7a1888da763370fee251c1e100b26ce8/2019/CVE-2019-17382.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/1beabb4b11662cd835a2974a73ab3608623a1bdc/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-17382.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2019-17382.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2019-17382-3976.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2019-17382.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2019/CVE-2019-17382/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2019-17382.py","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/pikpikcu/cves/CVE-2019-17382.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/pocsploit/blob/fe4a3154e59d2bebd55ccfdf62f4f7efb21b5a2a/modules/cves/2019/CVE-2019-17382.py","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2019-17382.yaml","https://github.com/K3ysTr0K3R/CVE-2019-17382-EXPLOIT"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0121.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0119","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0119.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-17233","title":"WordPress ultimate-faqs 插件 HTML 内容注入漏洞","description":"WordPress ultimate-faqs 插件 1.8.24 及以下版本的 Functions/EWD_UFAQ_Import.php 文件存在 HTML 内容注入漏洞（CWE-79）。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过构造恶意 HTML 载荷，利用该漏洞在用户浏览器中执行任意脚本代码。该漏洞影响使用受影响版本插件的 WordPress 网站，攻击复杂度低且无需权限，但需要用户点击恶意链接或访问注入页面方可触发成功，可导致会话劫持、网页篡改或钓鱼攻击等危害。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2019-17233"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-10-07T23:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:23:31Z","remediation":"建议立即将 WordPress ultimate-faqs 插件升级至 1.8.25 或更高版本（该版本已修复 HTML 注入漏洞）。如暂时无法升级，可在 WordPress 后台禁用该插件作为临时缓解措施，或在 WAF 层面配置规则拦截包含恶意 HTML/脚本内容的 FAQ 导入请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://blog.nintechnet.com/unauthenticated-options-import-vulnerability-in-wordpress-ultimate-faq-plugin/","https://wordpress.org/plugins/ultimate-faqs/#developers","https://wpvulndb.com/vulnerabilities/9883","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-17233.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-17233.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/1beabb4b11662cd835a2974a73ab3608623a1bdc/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-17233.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a7bcc119a9ab3b42563555b8edc8c417e3560925/cves/2019/17xxx/CVE-2019-17233.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-17233.md","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder2/CVE-2019-17233.yaml","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates-ai/blob/d476b10507a31f8cf4e68e148600e8de71a53d49/2019/CVE-2019-17233.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c77ca3ed9b9756399e7dd2586c1a3745e93a0ac9/CVE/data/2019/CVE-2019-17233.json","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/d89a4438a6b6037fedd5df1c832dbac48d3b31b3/nuclei-templates/2019/CVE-2019-17233-ultimate_faqs-67f9f44b-badc-48d5-b1d9-11cd6501fa9b.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2019/CVE-2019-17233.rules","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/552b84dd5dea4e2cd4311197c182e94e76651492/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2019-17233.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0119.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0118","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0118.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-17232","title":"WordPress ultimate-faqs插件未授权选项导入漏洞","description":"标签中。<value>WordPress ultimate-faqs 插件的 Functions/EWD_UFAQ_Import.php 文件存在身份验证缺失漏洞（CWE-306）。该漏洞影响 ultimate-faqs 插件 1.8.24 及以下版本，未经身份验证的远程攻击者可通过直接发送特制导入请求，利用该选项导入功能篡改网站配置或数据。由于该导入操作未对请求来源进行身份验证校验，任何网络可达的攻击者均可轻松触发，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2019-17232"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-10-07T23:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:23:31Z","remediation":"升级 ultimate-faqs 插件到 2.4.13 或更高版本，该版本已修复导入功能的身份验证绕过漏洞。如无法立即升级，请在 WordPress 后台临时禁用 ultimate-faqs 插件，或通过 .htaccess 限制对 wp-admin/admin-ajax.php 的未授权访问，以阻断未认证的选项导入请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://blog.nintechnet.com/unauthenticated-options-import-vulnerability-in-wordpress-ultimate-faq-plugin/","https://wordpress.org/plugins/ultimate-faqs/#developers","https://wpvulndb.com/vulnerabilities/9883","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-17232.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-17232.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/1beabb4b11662cd835a2974a73ab3608623a1bdc/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-17232.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a7bcc119a9ab3b42563555b8edc8c417e3560925/cves/2019/17xxx/CVE-2019-17232.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-17232.md","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder3/CVE-2019-17232.yaml","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates-ai/blob/d476b10507a31f8cf4e68e148600e8de71a53d49/2019/CVE-2019-17232.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/82509eeac924c04179aa9efa2ba736077707b551/CVE/data/2019/CVE-2019-17232.json","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/d89a4438a6b6037fedd5df1c832dbac48d3b31b3/nuclei-templates/2019/CVE-2019-17232-ultimate_faqs-eb562efb-eb17-4366-9f6d-02653df6ece1.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2019/CVE-2019-17232.rules","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/552b84dd5dea4e2cd4311197c182e94e76651492/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2019-17232.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0118.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0110","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0110.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-16931","title":"WordPress Visualizer插件 存储型跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress Visualizer 插件 3.3.0 存在存储型跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。该漏洞源于插件中的 wp-json/visualizer/v1/update-chart 接口未实施任何访问控制，且 classes/Visualizer/Render/Page/Data.php 文件缺乏输出净化处理。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可利用该漏洞向插件提交包含恶意 JavaScript 代码的图表数据，当管理员或其他特权用户通过 WordPress 后台编辑该图表时，恶意脚本将在其浏览器中执行，从而可能导致会话劫持、后台权限窃取或进一步的控制台操作。该漏洞影响使用 Visualizer 插件 3.3.0 版本的 WordPress 网站，攻击复杂度低，无需用户交互即可在管理员视角触发，危害等级为中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2019-16931"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-10-03T19:15:09Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:22:59Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Visualizer 插件升级到 3.3.1 或更高版本，该版本修复了 Gutenberg 块编辑器中未授权的 REST API 访问及输出过滤缺失问题。如暂时无法升级，可临时禁用该插件的 Gutenberg Block 功能，或在防火墙/WAF 层拦截对 wp-json/visualizer/v1/update-chart 的未授权访问请求，以阻止存储型 XSS 攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://nathandavison.com/blog/wordpress-visualizer-plugin-xss-and-ssrf","https://wordpress.org/plugins/visualizer/#developers","https://wpvulndb.com/vulnerabilities/9893","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-16931.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-16931.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e37a4971f7f088e6669385f053c7840848307aba/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-16931.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2019-16931.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-16931-3963.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/WordPress/CVE-2019-16931.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d38333dcfe51fc2081856da5d31bbece1a0cced/cves/2019/16xxx/CVE-2019-16931.json","https://github.com/veo/vscan/blob/1beb10c08e377e15b7dd417be1843bb75aa8c4f0/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/cves/2019/CVE-2019-16931.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-16931.md","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2019/CVE-2019-16931/poc/nuclei/CVE-2019-16931.yaml","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-16931.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-0110.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2019/EXP-AVE-2019-0110.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0110.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0112","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0112.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-16932","title":"WordPress Visualizer插件 服务器端请求伪造漏洞","description":"tags.<value>WordPress Visualizer 插件在 3.3.1 及之前版本中存在盲 SSRF 漏洞。攻击者可通过 wp-json/visualizer/v1/upload-data 接口，利用插件对远程 URL 的请求功能，诱导服务器向任意内部或外部目标发起 HTTP 请求。由于该漏洞为盲 SSRF，攻击者虽无法直接获取响应内容，但可探测内网服务、读取敏感文件或配合其他漏洞实现进一步入侵。所有使用该插件的 WordPress 站点均受影响，且无需身份认证即可利用。攻击者仅需构造恶意上传数据请求并指定目标 URL 即可触发漏洞。建议用户升级 Visualizer 插件至 3.3.1 或更高版本进行修复。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2019-16932"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-09-30T16:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:22:59Z","remediation":"立即将 WordPress Visualizer 插件升级至 3.3.1 或更高版本，可通过 WordPress 后台\"插件\"页面执行自动更新，或从 https://wordpress.org/plugins/visualizer/ 手动下载安装。如暂时无法升级补丁，建议在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）或 CDN 安全规则中拦截对 /wp-json/visualizer/v1/upload-data 端点的 POST 请求，或临时停用 Visualizer 插件以消除攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://nathandavison.com/blog/wordpress-visualizer-plugin-xss-and-ssrf","https://wordpress.org/plugins/visualizer/#developers","https://wpvulndb.com/vulnerabilities/9892","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-16932.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-16932.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e37a4971f7f088e6669385f053c7840848307aba/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-16932.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2019-16932.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2019-16932-3964.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/WordPress/CVE-2019-16932.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d38333dcfe51fc2081856da5d31bbece1a0cced/cves/2019/16xxx/CVE-2019-16932.json","https://github.com/veo/vscan/blob/1beb10c08e377e15b7dd417be1843bb75aa8c4f0/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/cves/2019/CVE-2019-16932.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-16932.md","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2019/CVE-2019-16932/poc/nuclei/CVE-2019-16932.yaml","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-16932.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0112.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0114","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0114.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-16997","title":"米拓 MetInfo CMS SQL注入漏洞","description":"MetInfo CMS 7.0.0beta 版本存在 SQL 注入漏洞，位于后台语言管理模块的 language_general.class.php 文件中，攻击路径为 admin/?n=language&c=language_general&a=doExportPack 接口的 appno 参数。由于该参数未进行充分的输入验证和参数化处理，具有后台管理员权限的认证攻击者可通过构造恶意的 SQL 语句，向数据库服务器发送特制请求，从而绕过身份验证机制直接执行任意 SQL 查询。该漏洞影响所有使用 MetInfo 7.0.0beta 版本的网站系统，攻击者可利用此漏洞获取数据库中的敏感信息（如管理员账号密码哈希、用户隐私数据、站点配置信息），甚至篡改或删除数据，导致严重的信息泄露和完整性破坏。CVSS v3.1 评分为 7.2（高危），攻击复杂度低，无需用户交互，但需要高权限账户才能触发。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2019-16997"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-09-30T13:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:23:07Z","remediation":"立即将 MetInfo 从 7.0.0 beta 升级至官方最新稳定版 8.1（下载地址 https://www.metinfo.cn/download/），该 SQL 注入漏洞已在后续稳定版本中修复。若暂无法升级，可临时将后台目录 admin 通过 Web 服务器配置限制为仅允许可信 IP 访问，并对 appno 参数进行严格的整数类型校验，阻止恶意 SQL 语句注入。升级完成后清除管理员会话并重新生成后台密码。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/XiaOkuoAi/XiaOkuoAi.github.io/issues/2","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-16997.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-16997.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e37a4971f7f088e6669385f053c7840848307aba/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-16997.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2019-16997.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-16997-3967.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-16997-3968.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-16997-3966.yaml","https://github.com/shadow1ng/fscan/blob/bf036fd9b272a56d493796badcf0a269f0a83ec0/webscan/pocs/metinfo-cve-2019-16997-sqli.yml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/MetInfo CMS/CVE-2019-16997.yaml","https://github.com/zan8in/afrog/blob/3ea4d34414bcc09b9e25a3f338294eca87e178ce/pocs/afrog-pocs/CVE/2019/CVE-2019-16997.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d38333dcfe51fc2081856da5d31bbece1a0cced/cves/2019/16xxx/CVE-2019-16997.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0114.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0113","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0113.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-16996","title":"MetInfo CMS SQL注入漏洞","description":"MetInfo 7.0.0beta 版本后台 product_admin 模块存在 SQL 注入漏洞。攻击者在获得高权限管理员身份后，可通过向 admin/?n=product&c=product_admin&a=dopara&app_type=shop 接口的 id 参数提交恶意 SQL 语句，绕过数据库查询过滤机制，实现对后台数据库的非法查询、篡改或删除操作。该漏洞影响使用 MetInfo 7.0.0beta 版本的网站系统，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。攻击者需具备管理员权限才能利用此漏洞，无需用户交互即可完成数据库注入攻击。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2019-16996"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-09-30T13:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:23:07Z","remediation":"立即升级至MetInfo 8.1或更高版本（当前最新版本），或从MetInfo 7.0.x直接升级到8.1版本，版本8.1已修复该SQL注入漏洞。在升级前如无法立即修复，建议通过修改product_admin.class.php文件中的参数验证逻辑或在Web应用防火墙中添加对product_admin类文件 suspicious parameter监控规则作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/XiaOkuoAi/XiaOkuoAi.github.io/issues/1","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-16996.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-16996.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e37a4971f7f088e6669385f053c7840848307aba/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-16996.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2019-16996.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-16996-3965.yaml","https://github.com/shadow1ng/fscan/blob/bf036fd9b272a56d493796badcf0a269f0a83ec0/webscan/pocs/metinfo-cve-2019-16996-sqli.yml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/MetInfo CMS/CVE-2019-16996.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/poc/metinfo/metinfo-cve-2019-16996-sqli.json","https://github.com/zan8in/afrog/blob/3ea4d34414bcc09b9e25a3f338294eca87e178ce/pocs/afrog-pocs/CVE/2019/CVE-2019-16996.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d38333dcfe51fc2081856da5d31bbece1a0cced/cve