以修复此问题。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-16920"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-09-27T12:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:22:57Z","remediation":"受影响 D-Link 路由器型号（DIR-655、DIR-866L、DIR-652、DHP-1565、DIR-855L、DAP-1533、DIR-862L、DIR-615、DIR-835、DIR-825）已确认 EOL，D-Link 不再发布修复固件。建议立即停用并更换为仍在官方支持周期内的 D-Link 新型号路由器。临时缓解措施：在路由器管理界面关闭远程管理（Remote Management/WAN 口访问），限制 Web 管理界面仅允许内网 IP 访问；在边界防火墙或上游设备上配置 ACL，阻止外部网络对 80/443 端口的未授权访问；定期更换设备管理密码并启用 WPA2/WPA3 无线加密。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://fortiguard.com/zeroday/FG-VD-19-117","https://medium.com/%4080vul/determine-the-device-model-affected-by-cve-2019-16920-by-zoomeye-bf6fec7f9bb3","https://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/766427","https://www.seebug.org/vuldb/ssvid-98079","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-16920","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-16920.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-16920.md","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2019-16920.yaml","https://github.com/amcai/myscan/blob/c0ed549669ec76cc9fea660554943244cbdd703b/myscan/pocs/perfolder/dlink/poc_dlink-cve-2019-16920-rce_2019.py","https://github.com/KiritoLoveAsuna/Exploits/blob/a7623c4720a5f8bbc9d24e9726397b947b0d0900/CVE-2019-16920.py","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2019-16920.yaml","https://github.com/Ares-X/VulWiki/blob/40e0273754a36f49a6be6a77a7a4c210a07063ed/IOT安全/D-Link/（CVE-2019-16920）D-Link rce.md","https://github.com/nosafer/nosafer.github.io/blob/1b07659147a7781a61e0b950684ad8d7739fadbd/docs/IOT安全/D-Link/（CVE-2019-16920）D-Link rce.md","https://github.com/badboycxcc/IoT_Vulnerability_Wiki/blob/04ed805079843620ae861d42c5be52958867c52c/docs/路由器/(CVE-2019-16920)D-Link-rce.md","https:/